OL,3,GNEWSANumber of sheep in Scotland with
OL,4,Abluetongue virus rises to eight
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo more sheep have been infected with
OL,7,Fthe bluetongue virus in the south of
OL,8,FScotland, bringing the total number
OL,9,Faffected to eight.
OL,11,FLatest figures released by the UK
OL,12,Fgovernment showed the two new
OL,13,Fbluetongue serotype 3 (BTV-3)
OL,14,Finfections were found in sheep on two
OL,15,Fdifferent farms.
OL,17,FBoth premises were tested following
OL,18,Freports of suspicious clinical signs.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
