OL,3,GNEWSANumber of sheep in Scotland with
OL,4,Abluetongue virus rises to eight
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe news came after temporary
OL,7,Frestrictions were introduced on the
OL,8,Fmovement of animals in Dumfries and
OL,9,FGalloway to prevent the spread of the
OL,10,Fpotentially deadly virus.
